1
00:00:00,328 --> 00:00:03,158
(Leonard:)I'm just gonna go home
and let my work speak for itself.

2
00:00:03,365 --> 00:00:05,265
(Raj:)You're right. This is beneath me.

3
00:00:05,467 --> 00:00:08,297
Like your mother was last night.

4
00:00:10,572 --> 00:00:11,632
(Leonard:)How about it, Sheldon?

5
00:00:12,674 --> 00:00:15,074
(Sheldon:)What do you think I should do?

6
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:18,180
(Amy:)Well, you'll always
be an academic success...

7
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:23,680
(Amy:)...but I seriously question
whether you'll make any more friends.

8
00:00:26,087 --> 00:00:28,787
Oh, I don't want any more, but let's go.

9
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:31,930
(Barry:)Are you kidding?
I would love to babysit for you.

10
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:35,030
- I could not ask you to do that.
- Nonsense, children love me.

11
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:39,190
(Barry:)Something about me
just makes them laugh and laugh.

12
00:00:45,807 --> 00:00:48,867
(Leonard:)No, we cannot lose to that jerk.

13
00:00:49,077 --> 00:00:52,237
- Yeah, screw it. I'm going in.
- Hold on.

14
00:00:53,348 --> 00:01:00,018
"Screw it, I'm going in"
is what I said to your mother last night.

